F(CX8) | F(APIC) | 0   | F(SYSCALL) |
F(MTRR) | F(PGE) | F(MCA) | F(CMOV) |
F(PAT) | F(PSE36) | 0   |
f_nx | 0   | F(MMXEXT) | F(MMX) |
F(FXSR) | F(FXSR_OPT) | f_gbpages | f_rdtscp |
0   | f_lm | F(3DNOWEXT) | F(3DNOW);
