F(XMM3) | F(PCLMULQDQ) | 0   |
0   |
0   | F(SSSE3) | 0   | 0   |
0   | F(CX16) | 0   |
0   | F(XMM4_1) |
F(XMM4_2) | F(X2APIC) | F(MOVBE) | F(POPCNT) |
